</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-24f0adf4-8eab-11f0-ba64-ff848cc5aa18\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7e402378-8eb6-11f0-ba64-47d777140d81\">개인명의 재산은</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4786709d-8eab-11f0-ba64-a767a316dfb2\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7e402379-8eb6-11f0-ba64-5d15ad91ffe0\">현금주고 구입한 </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4968ec72-8eab-11f0-ba64-75a7dbdcbf2e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7e40237a-8eb6-11f0-ba64-019173fad232\">중고차 한대 있습니다(2010년 소렌토R)</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-394fe28c-8ea5-11f0-ba64-fdede4f91a75\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7e40237b-8eb6-11f0-ba64-dfa1cea7e33d\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-38a5bfc7-8ea5-11f0-ba64-4f0d33d26ab6\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7e40237c-8eb6-11f0-ba64-3bf884fb292f\">아직 폐업전이긴하나</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-40b2256f-8ea5-11f0-ba64-df869ba0e639\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7e40237d-8eb6-11f0-ba64-f3c017b5da22\">조만간 폐업예정입니다</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d45c52db-8eaa-11f0-ba64-93ead7c0e188\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7e40237e-8eb6-11f0-ba64-557d106305f9\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d3f68c08-8eaa-11f0-ba64-e306c4c48b21\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7e40237f-8eb6-11f0-ba64-616f3ed29cdb\">현 상황에서 </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-aae73807-8eb5-11f0-ba64-8987dc7ee94a\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7e402380-8eb6-11f0-ba64-2fc65f73e504\">새출발기금 신청하여</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-950e1cc2-8eb5-11f0-ba64-7d63b2dd2380\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7e402381-8eb6-11f0-ba64-b910a60415ce\">신보위에 </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d94ea618-8eaa-11f0-ba64-d7144f08cee4\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7e402382-8eb6-11f0-ba64-6377cc430b38\">부실우려차주 접수</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a2167263-8eb5-11f0-ba64-a7fc9a7e887d\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7e402383-8eb6-11f0-ba64-89133141c569\">(인가 까지3~4개월/90일)기다리다</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-08025336-8eb5-11f0-ba64-13dda1c4632b\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7e402384-8eb6-11f0-ba64-d169ed32a2a4\">--&gt; 캠코에</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a72d8c1c-8eb5-11f0-ba64-b543585f63b5\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7e402385-8eb6-11f0-ba64-55cba187385f\">부실차주 신청(확정금액798000원) 을</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2ae6f90d-8eb5-11f0-ba64-131e0b85bdb4\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7e402386-8eb6-11f0-ba64-79363a4993d7\">3~4개월(90일 가량) 연체후,실효.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-6a221ac6-8eb5-11f0-ba64-41f875e42162\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7e402387-8eb6-11f0-ba64-45c0af0cf135\">최종감면 심사.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4a93f341-8eb5-11f0-ba64-6bcadde52cd6\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7e402388-8eb6-11f0-ba64-d791e7210e1c\">--&gt; 최종감면금액결정 변제(10년)</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e7215081-8eaa-11f0-ba64-4b183c511144\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7e402389-8eb6-11f0-ba64-8d606777aa28\">이렇게 하는게 최상이다</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f0fafb5a-8eaa-11f0-ba64-3f7b1bc51138\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7e40238a-8eb6-11f0-ba64-13da909c3a63\">라고 무료상담 변호사님께서</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-facd7a3b-8eaa-11f0-ba64-176f78f993a7\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7e40238b-8eb6-11f0-ba64-df9e8d90c60e\">조언을 해주셨는데요</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-eb8b87f3-8eb5-11f0-ba64-974ca6c3ef19\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7e40238c-8eb6-11f0-ba64-ef2f37072790\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-eb2e9a94-8eb5-11f0-ba64-71324800426d\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7e40238d-8eb6-11f0-ba64-7ff72db24661\">최종 감면 변제금 나올때까지</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-fb8a1274-8eb5-11f0-ba64-27d60c2b6d69\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7e40238e-8eb6-11f0-ba64-3341b76211dd\">한 1년에서 좀더 소요된다는데</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-052c32a1-8eb6-11f0-ba64-a92cbd433192\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7e40238f-8eb6-11f0-ba64-abf741526b5d\">가능성 있을까요?</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2ba2643a-8eb6-11f0-ba64-f12bf4cfba46\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7e402390-8eb6-11f0-ba64-c97b258e9445\">하게된다면 폐업후 하는게 나은가요</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3baada83-8eb6-11f0-ba64-31e31d0dc80f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7e402391-8eb6-11f0-ba64-cd592acaad12\">어차피 한두달후 폐업은 하겠으나</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5b72d633-8eb6-11f0-ba64-2d663c8373aa\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7e402392-8eb6-11f0-ba64-ad12cc185d56\">당분간 가게 운영중 지금이라도</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-45274a14-8eb6-11f0-ba64-b11722777851\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7e402393-8eb6-11f0-ba64-41e631ae737a\">하는게 나은가요?</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-6c965970-8eb6-11f0-ba64-ffac4242de23\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7e402394-8eb6-11f0-ba64-11ab91da09fa\">선배님들의 소중한 댓글 기다립니다</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5c737f2d-8eab-11f0-ba64-136b5f873902\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7e402395-8eb6-11f0-ba64-398059646a5e\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=